{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7ee6a207-970c-8617-9be3-d867aff444a1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:43:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, great, thanks for picking up! My name is Alan Peckham, and I've got a real problem over here at 184 Memorial Boulevard, the Easton's Beach side. After the soaker that ended yesterday, I got water in my cellar!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:40:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Okay, 184 Memorial Boulevard. How much water are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches! Seeped right in along the back wall. I've been in this house years and that has never happened, not once. And it was not this bad last winter, I'll tell you that. The drain out front was just overflowing, the street was a river!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:41:15-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so the storm drain in front of your place was backed up during the rain. Let me get that down. Storm drain, front of 184 Memorial, water into the cellar, a few inches. Is the drain still holding water now, or has it gone down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:41:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gone down mostly, but it's all full of leaves and sand and junk. Wonderful, right? I'm sure that's the whole problem, it can't swallow anything!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:41:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it, especially with that much rain at once. Debris on the grate, I'll put that in. Anything else going on out there, like a sinkhole or the road caving in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nothing like that. Just the drain. Oh, and I drove by Bellevue earlier and that looked pretty bad too, but that's not my deal, I just want mine looked at!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we'll stick to yours. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check and clear the drain. Do you want a call back on this number you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:42:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, great, it's 401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:42:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0186, got it. Now, they'll prioritize after a storm like this, there's a lot of drains on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Okay, do the crews work on weekends? Because it's Friday and if it rains again I'm going to be bailing out my cellar!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They can, yeah, if it's urgent they'll go out. I'll mark this one as water into a building so it gets bumped up. Could be today, could be early next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful! Because honestly I've got to run, I have to pick up from after-school care and it ends at five thirty sharp. They charge you if you're late, it's brutal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:43:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, no problem. If somebody's out there while you're gone, is it okay for them to just work on the drain in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:43:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's right on the street, they don't need me. Just clear it out, please!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:43:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. So that's 184 Memorial Boulevard, drain out front clogged, water in the cellar, callback at 401-555-0186. You're all set, Mr. Peckham."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:43:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you so much Kevin! Have a good one!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, stay dry out there."
    }
  ],
